.TH scan_quotedprintable 3 "Version 1.0" "December 2023" "lib/textcode"
.SH NAME
scan_quotedprintable \- Scan and decode Quoted-Printable encoded content
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <lib/textcode.h>
.sp
.BI "size_t scan_quotedprintable(const char* src, char* dest, size_t* destlen)"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The function .BR scan_quotedprintable () scans and decodes Quoted-Printable encoded content. The function takes the following parameters:
.sp
1. A pointer to the source Quoted-Printable encoded string.
2. A pointer to the destination buffer.
3. A pointer to the size of the destination buffer.
.sp
The function returns the number of bytes processed from the source string.
.SH RETURN VALUE
The number of bytes processed from the source string.
.SH EXAMPLES
No examples are provided for this function.
